# Home sections

## Hero pair

Two full-viewport bands, same `HomeHero.vue`:

1. **madd** — text left, photo right (`hero_image_url`)
2. **.lines** — photo left, text right (`reversed`, `hero_lines_image_url`)

Copy is hardcoded (`madd` / `.lines`), not the old art/music quote. Desktop height is `100dvh - --site-header-height`. Photos use `object-fit: contain`. Both uploads go to ImageKit folder `site/hero` as **separate** slots — do not bind both bands to one URL. Empty slots may use `PLACEHOLDER_ARTWORK`.

## Stack (do not reorder unless asked)

Hero (madd) → Hero reversed (.lines) → About me → My Art → Artwork marquee → Wanna Do’s → Reviews

There is **no about section** on the storefront or in customize. Do not restore `HomeAboutSection` or the admin about preview (portrait, quote, statement, about background). Leftover `about_*` Mongo fields may still save so old files are not wiped.

## Header destinations

Three items in `useStorefrontSectionNav` / `storefrontSections.js`:

| Label | Scrolls to | Also covers |
|---|---|---|
| **me** | top of the page | hero pair + about me |
| **my art** | `#my-art` heading | gallery + wanna-dos |
| **say hi** | footer `#say-hi` | contact + book |

Old hashes (`#about`, `#gallery`, `#contact`) still resolve to those three. `#say-hi` must land **below** the floated header (account for `--nav-float-top`). Do not use 640px for header layout — header breakpoint is 768px (`site-header.mdc`).

## Shared marquee

Reviews and the artwork strip use the **same** motion and tile size:

- `HomeMarqueeSection.vue` — track, 40s loop, 32px gap, fades, pause on hover
- `MarqueeTile.vue` — 360×280 (320×240 mobile), same radius / hairline / spotlight

Do not fork a second marquee CSS file or a different tile size for reviews vs artwork. Reviews use the quote variant; artwork is image-only in the same tile.

## About me pair

`HomeAboutMeSection.vue`: two tall columns (~88vh / 78vh mobile) with `useScrollParallax` at different Y rates.

Images come from public home page `about_me_left_image_url` / `about_me_right_image_url` (admin customize slots). Empty slots may use `PLACEHOLDER_ARTWORK` until a photo is saved. Parallax only through `useScrollParallax` / `useSectionBackgroundParallax`.
